177
00:07:20,870 --> 00:07:21,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just drink it.</font>

178
00:07:22,750 --> 00:07:24,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This champagne must be expensive.</font>

179
00:07:24,480 --> 00:07:25,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's not champagne.</font>

180
00:07:25,680 --> 00:07:26,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sparkling wine.</font>

181
00:07:27,360 --> 00:07:29,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's cheaper than champagne but tastes the same.</font>

182
00:07:29,750 --> 00:07:31,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Think of it as a substitute for champagne.</font>

183
00:07:32,000 --> 00:07:33,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Substitute.</font>

184
00:07:33,870 --> 00:07:35,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The wine is a substitute.</font>

185
00:07:35,430 --> 00:07:37,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The fresh-air system is also a substitute.</font>

186
00:07:38,000 --> 00:07:39,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We only deserve substitutes, right?</font>

187
00:07:41,000 --> 00:07:42,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's almost the same.</font>

188
00:07:42,800 --> 00:07:44,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right? Almost the same.</font>

189
00:07:50,120 --> 00:07:50,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Try it.</font>

190
00:07:53,190 --> 00:07:53,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then...</font>

191
00:07:55,950 --> 00:07:56,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on.</font>

192
00:07:56,560 --> 00:07:57,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's have a toast.</font>

193
00:08:03,190 --> 00:08:03,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I told you so.</font>

194
00:08:03,870 --> 00:08:04,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">See?</font>

195
00:08:04,870 --> 00:08:06,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I, the mascot, shouldn't have left.</font>

196
00:08:06,360 --> 00:08:07,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I was only gone for a few days,</font>

197
00:08:07,690 --> 00:08:08,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and so many things happened.</font>

198
00:08:10,370 --> 00:08:11,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tell me about that...</font>

199
00:08:11,830 --> 00:08:12,930
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just tell me.</font>

200
00:08:13,240 --> 00:08:14,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There's nothing to talk about.</font>

201
00:08:14,240 --> 00:08:16,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Didn't you already know about all the bad things?</font>

202
00:08:16,830 --> 00:08:18,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tell me about the good things that happened to you.</font>

203
00:08:18,630 --> 00:08:20,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What good things did you bring to us?</font>

204
00:08:20,630 --> 00:08:21,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The funeral expo, right?</font>

205
00:08:22,120 --> 00:08:23,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Well, it's like this.</font>

206
00:08:25,160 --> 00:08:26,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Have you tried the beer I bought</font>

207
00:08:26,630 --> 00:08:28,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">from Qingdao Airport?</font>

208
00:08:28,360 --> 00:08:29,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's authentic.</font>

209
00:08:29,120 --> 00:08:29,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">From the first factory.</font>

210
00:08:29,870 --> 00:08:31,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I had to ask someone for it.</font>

211
00:08:35,750 --> 00:08:36,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Team Leader Cao.</font>

212
00:08:37,120 --> 00:08:37,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I just want to know</font>

213
00:08:38,000 --> 00:08:38,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">why you</font>

214
00:08:38,840 --> 00:08:40,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">couldn't bring back the fresh-air system.</font>

215
00:08:43,000 --> 00:08:43,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's sit and talk.</font>

216
00:08:45,750 --> 00:08:46,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on, Mao Erzhe.</font>

217
00:08:52,270 --> 00:08:53,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Well, about this...</font>

218
00:08:54,750 --> 00:08:56,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You won't let me go without an explanation, right?</font>

219
00:09:04,750 --> 00:09:05,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Before going to the funeral expo,</font>

220
00:09:06,270 --> 00:09:06,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the director</font>

221
00:09:07,200 --> 00:09:08,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">gathered the person in charge of every department</font>

222
00:09:08,390 --> 00:09:09,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">for a meeting.</font>

223
00:09:09,720 --> 00:09:10,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We could bring in new equipment,</font>

224
00:09:11,480 --> 00:09:12,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">but</font>

225
00:09:12,720 --> 00:09:14,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the KPI must also increase.</font>

226
00:09:14,510 --> 00:09:15,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They want numbers.</font>

227
00:09:15,600 --> 00:09:16,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How do I report it?</font>

228
00:09:16,670 --> 00:09:17,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How?</font>

229
00:09:17,790 --> 00:09:18,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just report it as normal.</font>

230
00:09:19,000 --> 00:09:20,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't they know the usual numbers</font>

231
00:09:20,240 --> 00:09:21,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">of the mortuary prep team?</font>

232
00:09:21,390 --> 00:09:22,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is that the number I'm talking about?</font>

233
00:09:22,480 --> 00:09:24,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do you think that's what I mean, Dandan?</font>

234
00:09:25,320 --> 00:09:26,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What do you mean then?</font>

235
00:09:26,870 --> 00:09:29,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Other departments are eating meat,</font>

236
00:09:29,600 --> 00:09:30,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">but the mortuary prep team</font>

237
00:09:31,000 --> 00:09:32,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">can only drink soup.</font>

238
00:09:32,240 --> 00:09:33,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Everyone else has good things.</font>

239
00:09:33,840 --> 00:09:34,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why do we</font>

240
00:09:34,960 --> 00:09:36,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">only get a demo unit?</font>

241
00:09:36,630 --> 00:09:38,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Not only does the cremation team's new equipment</font>

242
00:09:38,840 --> 00:09:41,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">reduce family members' waiting time,</font>

243
00:09:41,270 --> 00:09:42,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">but it can also increase the quality of the ashes.</font>

244
00:09:42,910 --> 00:09:44,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The fleet and business department's</font>

245
00:09:44,750 --> 00:09:45,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">KPI</font>

246
00:09:45,750 --> 00:09:46,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">are policies that benefit the public</font>

247
00:09:47,240 --> 00:09:48,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and prevent the masses from being scammed by agents.</font>

248
00:09:49,270 --> 00:09:50,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Ceremonial Services Department bought new equipment</font>

249
00:09:50,790 --> 00:09:53,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to increase the memorial services' quality immensely</font>

250
00:09:53,360 --> 00:09:54,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and fulfill the family members' requests.</font>

251
00:09:54,840 --> 00:09:55,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They can even create revenue.</font>

252
00:09:56,270 --> 00:09:57,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How do we, the mortuary prep team,</font>

253
00:09:57,480 --> 00:09:58,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">increase our KPI?</font>

254
00:09:59,630 --> 00:10:02,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do we need to handle more deceased?</font>

255
00:10:08,750 --> 00:10:11,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So we only deserve new equipment</font>

256
00:10:11,360 --> 00:10:12,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">when we die?</font>

257
00:10:12,840 --> 00:10:14,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We suffocate ourselves</font>

258
00:10:14,750 --> 00:10:16,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">with burnt mugwort all the time.</font>

259
00:10:16,870 --> 00:10:19,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tianshuang has frostbite on her waist.</font>

260
00:10:19,720 --> 00:10:21,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Dandan's hands are full of blisters.</font>

261
00:10:21,360 --> 00:10:23,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do you even know how much we've suffered?</font>

262
00:10:23,120 --> 00:10:24,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How do I not know?</font>

263
00:10:24,390 --> 00:10:26,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Dandan and I started as Fifth Level Workers.</font>

264
00:10:26,240 --> 00:10:27,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Back then, we had a worse working environment.</font>

265
00:10:27,960 --> 00:10:28,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Did we complain?</font>

266
00:10:28,840 --> 00:10:29,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ask Dandan.</font>

267
00:10:29,720 --> 00:10:31,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why ask me? It's pointless.</font>

268
00:10:32,270 --> 00:10:33,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Must we continue doing this if that's what we did in the past?</font>

269
00:10:34,000 --> 00:10:34,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is that the right thing to do?</font>

270
00:10:35,200 --> 00:10:36,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Should they also do the same?</font>

271
00:10:41,750 --> 00:10:43,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm not saying I won't solve the problem.</font>

272
00:10:43,240 --> 00:10:44,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I said it'd happen in the near future.</font>

273
00:10:44,390 --> 00:10:45,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can't you just wait?</font>

274
00:10:45,390 --> 00:10:47,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ask them if they still want to hear the words</font>

275
00:10:47,120 --> 00:10:48,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">"in the near future".</font>

276
00:10:49,000 --> 00:10:49,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What's the point?</font>

277
00:10:51,000 --> 00:10:51,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Exactly.</font>

278
00:10:51,720 --> 00:10:53,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm not requesting these things</font>

279
00:10:53,360 --> 00:10:54,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">for myself.</font>

280
00:10:54,600 --> 00:10:56,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm requesting it for the mortuary prep team.</font>

281
00:10:56,360 --> 00:10:57,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't want it in the near future.</font>

282
00:10:58,000 --> 00:10:58,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I want it now.</font>

283
00:10:59,320 --> 00:11:00,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go and ask for it now!</font>

284
00:11:00,630 --> 00:11:01,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tell the director our numbers!</font>

285
00:11:01,750 --> 00:11:02,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Report it to him!</font>

286
00:11:02,360 --> 00:11:04,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're always going on and on</font>

287
00:11:04,200 --> 00:11:05,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">about the director.</font>

288
00:11:05,240 --> 00:11:05,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tell me!</font>

289
00:11:06,000 --> 00:11:07,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do you still care about the mortuary prep team?</font>

290
00:11:07,750 --> 00:11:09,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You only care about the director.</font>

291
00:11:09,720 --> 00:11:10,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You said it yourself.</font>

292
00:11:10,960 --> 00:11:11,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Protect the staff.</font>

293
00:11:11,960 --> 00:11:13,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Have you protected us?</font>

294
00:11:13,510 --> 00:11:14,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Fine!</font>

295
00:11:14,360 --> 00:11:15,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You'll go to the next funeral expo!</font>

296
00:11:15,840 --> 00:11:16,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go and purchase them for me.</font>

297
00:11:16,750 --> 00:11:17,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You are the team leader!</font>

298
00:11:17,480 --> 00:11:18,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why must we solve a problem</font>

299
00:11:18,600 --> 00:11:19,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that you can't solve?</font>

300
00:11:19,840 --> 00:11:22,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why do we need you as team leader then?</font>

301
00:11:31,840 --> 00:11:32,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I quit!</font>

302
00:11:32,960 --> 00:11:33,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You can be the team leader if you want!</font>

303
00:11:35,000 --> 00:11:36,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's how you are!</font>

304
00:11:36,240 --> 00:11:38,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You run away when something happens!</font>

305
00:11:38,870 --> 00:11:39,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Behave like a team leader!</font>

306
00:11:42,440 --> 00:11:43,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're making so much noise</font>

307
00:11:43,870 --> 00:11:44,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">during dinner.</font>

308
00:11:44,600 --> 00:11:45,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Show some manners!</font>

309
00:11:45,840 --> 00:11:46,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Be quiet!</font>

310
00:11:47,240 --> 00:11:47,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sorry.</font>

311
00:11:47,960 --> 00:11:49,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sorry.</font>

312
00:11:49,360 --> 00:11:50,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Sorry. - Sorry.</font>

313
00:11:50,390 --> 00:11:51,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sorry, everyone.</font>

314
00:11:51,480 --> 00:11:52,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's fine. Let him leave.</font>

315
00:11:52,480 --> 00:11:53,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't get angry.</font>

316
00:11:53,030 --> 00:11:54,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's enjoy our meals. Don't be angry.</font>

317
00:11:58,630 --> 00:12:00,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You just affected our dinner.</font>

318
00:12:00,720 --> 00:12:01,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My boss said</font>

319
00:12:02,240 --> 00:12:03,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">if every pretty lady here</font>

320
00:12:04,480 --> 00:12:05,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">drank this glass of wine,</font>

321
00:12:06,000 --> 00:12:06,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">he would forget about it.</font>

322
00:12:07,790 --> 00:12:08,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I...</font>

323
00:12:09,750 --> 00:12:10,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This has nothing to do with you.</font>

324
00:12:11,000 --> 00:12:12,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sure. I'll drink.</font>

325
00:12:12,750 --> 00:12:13,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Dandan. - Dandan.</font>

326
00:12:13,630 --> 00:12:15,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Cheers. Sorry</font>

327
00:12:15,360 --> 00:12:16,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">for disturbing all of you.</font>

328
00:12:22,030 --> 00:12:26,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I said every pretty lady had to drink.</font>

329
00:12:26,750 --> 00:12:27,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's enough.</font>

330
00:12:27,730 --> 00:12:29,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Show some respect. - It's fine. I'll drink.</font>

331
00:12:29,380 --> 00:12:30,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Come on. - Come on.</font>

332
00:12:30,240 --> 00:12:30,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Come on. - Don't drink.</font>

333
00:12:30,870 --> 00:12:31,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">All of us</font>

334
00:12:31,870 --> 00:12:33,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">will apologize to your boss.</font>

335
00:12:33,510 --> 00:12:34,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sorry.</font>

336
00:12:34,630 --> 00:12:35,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We'll drink.</font>

337
00:12:35,240 --> 00:12:35,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sorry.</font>

338
00:12:35,840 --> 00:12:36,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sorry.</font>

339
00:12:38,120 --> 00:12:38,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Batian.</font>

340
00:12:42,600 --> 00:12:43,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Batian.</font>

341
00:12:43,480 --> 00:12:44,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Forget him.</font>

342
00:12:44,440 --> 00:12:45,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's eat.</font>

343
00:12:47,910 --> 00:12:48,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Keep drinking.</font>

344
00:12:49,630 --> 00:12:50,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Everyone,</font>

345
00:12:50,360 --> 00:12:51,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">sorry about that.</font>

346
00:12:52,000 --> 00:12:52,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My boss asked</font>

347
00:12:53,080 --> 00:12:53,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the three ladies</font>

348
00:12:53,840 --> 00:12:55,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to have a drink with us.</font>

349
00:12:55,270 --> 00:12:56,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's have fun together.</font>

350
00:12:56,480 --> 00:12:56,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right?</font>

351
00:12:57,240 --> 00:12:57,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ladies.</font>

352
00:12:58,000 --> 00:12:58,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What are you doing?</font>

353
00:12:59,630 --> 00:13:00,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who do you think you are?</font>

354
00:13:03,360 --> 00:13:04,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What do you want?</font>

355
00:13:04,960 --> 00:13:06,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you disrespecting my boss?</font>

356
00:13:08,510 --> 00:13:10,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qingliangshan employee handbook.</font>

357
00:13:16,000 --> 00:13:17,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Put the deceased to eternal rest.</font>

358
00:13:19,240 --> 00:13:20,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Help the living find peace.</font>

359
00:13:24,240 --> 00:13:26,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Protect our employees at all times.</font>

360
00:13:43,270 --> 00:13:45,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That day, Team Leader Cao</font>

361
00:13:45,200 --> 00:13:47,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">became a hero in our hearts.</font>

362
00:13:48,000 --> 00:13:50,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Although he isn't as tall as a superhero,</font>

363
00:13:50,960 --> 00:13:52,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">perhaps just as tall as Nezha,</font>

364
00:13:53,080 --> 00:13:56,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">he puts our hearts at ease whenever he's around.</font>

365
00:13:57,120 --> 00:13:57,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">After that incident,</font>

366
00:13:58,120 --> 00:14:00,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the four of us silently prepared for the competition.</font>

367
00:14:00,840 --> 00:14:02,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Dandan might've said she didn't care,</font>

368
00:14:02,970 --> 00:14:05,470
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">but she expected a lot more from us lately.</font>

369
00:14:06,630 --> 00:14:08,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The team leader seems free,</font>

370
00:14:09,080 --> 00:14:11,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">but he'll go and have a conversation with the director.</font>

371
00:14:11,390 --> 00:14:14,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">In truth, he had gotten a lot of information for us.</font>

372
00:14:14,960 --> 00:14:15,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Deep down, we knew</font>

373
00:14:16,270 --> 00:14:18,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that the Skills Competition is a good stage.</font>

374
00:14:19,360 --> 00:14:20,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We wanted to show ourselves</font>

375
00:14:21,200 --> 00:14:23,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and let everyone know</font>

376
00:14:23,080 --> 00:14:24,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">about the Qingliangshan mortuary prep team</font>

377
00:14:25,600 --> 00:14:26,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">as if we would get</font>

378
00:14:26,720 --> 00:14:28,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the budget for the fresh-air system by doing that.</font>

379
00:14:29,750 --> 00:14:30,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And it might just happen.</font>

380
00:14:31,360 --> 00:14:32,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Some things</font>

381
00:14:32,480 --> 00:14:33,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">might become true</font>

382
00:14:33,670 --> 00:14:34,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">when you keep doing it.</font>

383
00:14:35,910 --> 00:14:36,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Oh, right.</font>

384
00:14:36,840 --> 00:14:39,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Something also happened between summer and autumn.</font>

385
00:14:39,750 --> 00:14:41,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mao and I pooled our money to buy a wheelchair</font>

386
00:14:41,670 --> 00:14:42,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">for Tianshuang.</font>

387
00:14:42,750 --> 00:14:44,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That way, if her waist hurts again,</font>

388
00:14:44,320 --> 00:14:46,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">she won't have to be carried by Mao again.</font>

389
00:14:47,120 --> 00:14:48,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">For some reason,</font>

390
00:14:48,870 --> 00:14:50,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">she kept rolling her eyes at me those few days.</font>

391
00:14:51,320 --> 00:14:52,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't get it.</font>

392
00:14:53,080 --> 00:14:53,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mao told me</font>

393
00:14:54,510 --> 00:14:55,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">he didn't get it either.</font>

394
00:15:19,220 --> 00:15:29,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Skills Competition, we are coming! Countdown: 75 days]</font>

395
00:15:37,550 --> 00:15:39,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why aren't you wearing long sleeves?</font>

396
00:15:40,150 --> 00:15:41,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's too thick.</font>

397
00:15:42,320 --> 00:15:43,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The weather is still hot.</font>

398
00:15:44,270 --> 00:15:45,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What are you doing after work?</font>

399
00:15:46,670 --> 00:15:48,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's invite Tianshuang and Mao</font>

400
00:15:48,390 --> 00:15:49,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to an escape room.</font>

401
00:15:49,720 --> 00:15:50,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's scary.</font>

402
00:15:51,080 --> 00:15:52,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No.</font>

403
00:15:52,030 --> 00:15:52,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm afraid of that.</font>

404
00:15:52,720 --> 00:15:54,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's way too terrifying.</font>

405
00:15:54,320 --> 00:15:55,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't think so.</font>

406
00:15:55,440 --> 00:15:56,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We are doing this every day</font>

407
00:15:56,670 --> 00:15:57,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and you're still...</font>

408
00:16:00,150 --> 00:16:00,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mom.</font>

409
00:16:01,630 --> 00:16:02,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mrs. Chen.</font>

410
00:16:03,960 --> 00:16:04,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come here.</font>

411
00:16:04,480 --> 00:16:05,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What are you looking at?</font>

412
00:16:05,320 --> 00:16:05,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come here.</font>

413
00:16:05,910 --> 00:16:06,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thank you.</font>

414
00:16:07,200 --> 00:16:09,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The lights brought in by the Ceremonial Services Department</font>

415
00:16:09,200 --> 00:16:10,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">are in use today.</font>

416
00:16:10,630 --> 00:16:11,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Look. They are nice. - He enjoyed a lively atmosphere.</font>

417
00:16:12,240 --> 00:16:14,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">During Chinese New Year, he loved going to lantern festivals.</font>

418
00:16:15,200 --> 00:16:16,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Today, he finally got to see it.</font>

419
00:16:16,870 --> 00:16:17,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thank you.</font>

420
00:16:18,200 --> 00:16:18,750
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Not at all.</font>

421
00:16:18,750 --> 00:16:20,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- It's our duty. - What filial kids.</font>

422
00:16:21,150 --> 00:16:21,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Look at this service.</font>

423
00:16:21,840 --> 00:16:23,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Allowing the elderly to pass at ease</font>

424
00:16:23,150 --> 00:16:24,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is our duty.</font>

425
00:16:24,030 --> 00:16:24,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">All right.</font>

426
00:16:25,390 --> 00:16:26,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When Dad passes away,</font>

427
00:16:26,910 --> 00:16:27,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm going to do this for him.</font>

428
00:16:28,320 --> 00:16:29,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Not only am I doing this,</font>

429
00:16:29,670 --> 00:16:31,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll also prepare lights that look like wine bottles</font>

430
00:16:31,510 --> 00:16:33,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">so he can drink as much as he wants on the other side.</font>

431
00:16:33,240 --> 00:16:33,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What do you think?</font>

432
00:16:33,720 --> 00:16:34,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You...</font>

433
00:16:36,910 --> 00:16:37,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mrs. Chen.</font>

434
00:16:37,360 --> 00:16:37,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wang Can.</font>

435
00:16:38,630 --> 00:16:40,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You came back a long time ago,</font>

436
00:16:40,200 --> 00:16:41,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">but I haven't even treated you to a meal.</font>

437
00:16:41,870 --> 00:16:43,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've got so much to deal with, both at home and outside.</font>

438
00:16:43,200 --> 00:16:43,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's fine.</font>

439
00:16:43,750 --> 00:16:44,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're too polite, Mrs. Chen.</font>

440
00:16:45,280 --> 00:16:47,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Indeed, the lights look good.</font>

441
00:16:48,120 --> 00:16:48,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right?</font>

442
00:16:49,360 --> 00:16:50,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Our funeral home</font>

443
00:16:51,150 --> 00:16:52,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">has had old equipment for so many years.</font>

444
00:16:52,870 --> 00:16:53,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's the right time to change.</font>

445
00:16:55,120 --> 00:16:55,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes.</font>

446
00:16:55,910 --> 00:16:57,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The funeral industry has been changing so quickly.</font>

447
00:16:58,670 --> 00:17:00,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why are you still so obsessed</font>

448
00:17:00,480 --> 00:17:01,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">with growing old with your partner forever?</font>

449
00:17:03,120 --> 00:17:03,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Seriously.</font>

450
00:17:04,240 --> 00:17:05,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You...</font>

451
00:17:05,750 --> 00:17:07,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What nonsense are you talking about in front of a stranger?</font>

452
00:17:10,480 --> 00:17:11,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He is not a stranger.</font>

453
00:17:15,200 --> 00:17:16,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He is my colleague.</font>

454
00:17:19,240 --> 00:17:19,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes.</font>

455
00:17:19,960 --> 00:17:21,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He's a colleague. Just...</font>

456
00:17:22,110 --> 00:17:24,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mom, you keep saying strangers.</font>

457
00:17:24,680 --> 00:17:26,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do you even know what a stranger is?</font>

458
00:17:26,960 --> 00:17:28,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You married my father.</font>

459
00:17:28,680 --> 00:17:29,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So what?</font>

460
00:17:30,480 --> 00:17:32,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Has he treated you like family?</font>

461
00:17:33,680 --> 00:17:35,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Since he had an accident after drinking,</font>

462
00:17:35,440 --> 00:17:37,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">has he ever considered your feelings even once?</font>

463
00:17:39,110 --> 00:17:39,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wang Can and I</font>

464
00:17:40,640 --> 00:17:41,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">are colleagues</font>

465
00:17:42,110 --> 00:17:43,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">but as long as we are working together,</font>

466
00:17:43,400 --> 00:17:44,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we always consider each other's feelings</font>

467
00:17:44,920 --> 00:17:46,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">during work.</font>

468
00:17:47,720 --> 00:17:49,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We don't need to get married.</font>

469
00:17:49,200 --> 00:17:50,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">As long as we've carried a coffin together,</font>

470
00:17:50,400 --> 00:17:51,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we are no longer strangers.</font>

471
00:18:08,060 --> 00:18:09,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Dear]</font>

472
00:18:20,640 --> 00:18:21,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mrs. Chen.</font>

473
00:18:22,270 --> 00:18:23,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's fine. Go back to work.</font>

474
00:18:23,720 --> 00:18:24,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I have something to tell you.</font>

475
00:18:24,830 --> 00:18:25,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I just remembered</font>

476
00:18:25,830 --> 00:18:27,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that my mother often mentions you at home.</font>

477
00:18:27,400 --> 00:18:29,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She said she had fun playing Mahjong with you.</font>

478
00:18:29,270 --> 00:18:30,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She asked you when you would be free.</font>

479
00:18:30,830 --> 00:18:31,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Anything will do.</font>

480
00:18:31,640 --> 00:18:33,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Choir</font>

481
00:18:33,540 --> 00:18:35,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- or Square Dance... - Wang Can, let's go.</font>

482
00:18:36,240 --> 00:18:37,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just call her anytime.</font>

483
00:18:40,590 --> 00:18:41,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm here.</font>

484
00:18:49,660 --> 00:18:52,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Dear]</font>

485
00:19:05,270 --> 00:19:05,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hexu.</font>

486
00:19:06,720 --> 00:19:08,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">These two deceased wanted floral arrangements,</font>

487
00:19:08,550 --> 00:19:08,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">right?</font>

488
00:19:09,640 --> 00:19:10,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes.</font>

489
00:19:10,400 --> 00:19:11,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When will the Floral Arrangement team be here?</font>

490
00:19:12,680 --> 00:19:13,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They are here.</font>

491
00:19:17,880 --> 00:19:18,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Dandan.</font>

492
00:19:18,720 --> 00:19:20,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why did they send both of you?</font>

493
00:19:20,680 --> 00:19:22,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Today's floral arrangement is easy.</font>

494
00:19:22,270 --> 00:19:23,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It won't require both your skills.</font>

495
00:19:24,160 --> 00:19:24,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We are</font>

496
00:19:24,750 --> 00:19:26,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">no longer needed upstairs.</font>

497
00:19:27,070 --> 00:19:27,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes.</font>

498
00:19:27,750 --> 00:19:29,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Mortuary Care Department</font>

499
00:19:29,110 --> 00:19:30,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">brought in a three-minute smart floral arrangement machine.</font>

500
00:19:31,200 --> 00:19:32,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just do it according to the numbers in the picture.</font>

501
00:19:32,680 --> 00:19:35,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Even an amateur can make a good wreath.</font>

502
00:19:36,480 --> 00:19:37,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come over here.</font>

503
00:19:37,860 --> 00:19:38,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Sure. - Thank you.</font>

504
00:19:45,070 --> 00:19:46,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We have blurry eyes.</font>

505
00:19:46,960 --> 00:19:49,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We can't see</font>

506
00:19:50,110 --> 00:19:51,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">all those pictures and tutorials clearly.</font>

507
00:19:52,110 --> 00:19:53,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Those pictures look nice.</font>

508
00:19:54,070 --> 00:19:55,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The clients like them.</font>

509
00:19:56,510 --> 00:19:58,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When we used to learn flower arranging,</font>

510
00:19:58,920 --> 00:20:01,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">learning how to create the outline of a whale fall</font>

511
00:20:01,590 --> 00:20:02,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">would take us long enough.</font>

512
00:20:03,720 --> 00:20:04,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Borrow the flowers' charm.</font>

513
00:20:05,510 --> 00:20:06,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Shape the branches with intention.</font>

514
00:20:07,480 --> 00:20:09,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How to prevent the dense blooms from blocking the light?</font>

515
00:20:09,480 --> 00:20:11,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How to preserve a quiet restraint with the lush green leaves?</font>

516
00:20:11,480 --> 00:20:13,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Those are some old rules.</font>

517
00:20:13,510 --> 00:20:14,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Now, a few pictures</font>

518
00:20:15,270 --> 00:20:16,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">help explain everything clearly.</font>

519
00:20:16,920 --> 00:20:17,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Indeed.</font>

520
00:20:19,440 --> 00:20:20,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We will no longer be needed soon.</font>

521
00:20:33,440 --> 00:20:35,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is it not busy down there?</font>

522
00:20:37,920 --> 00:20:38,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There are many celebrations of life today.</font>

523
00:20:39,200 --> 00:20:40,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Mortuary Care Department took some of our workload.</font>

524
00:20:42,350 --> 00:20:42,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Director,</font>

525
00:20:43,480 --> 00:20:45,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've finished writing everything you gave me.</font>

526
00:20:46,480 --> 00:20:48,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I want you to give me more.</font>

527
00:20:48,640 --> 00:20:50,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Zhou Ning, Director of Ceremonial Services Department]
You can learn from a tutor outside</font>

528
00:20:50,920 --> 00:20:53,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">if you want to cultivate your mind and body.</font>

529
00:20:53,680 --> 00:20:54,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My handwriting</font>

530
00:20:55,270 --> 00:20:55,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">isn't proper.</font>

531
00:20:58,920 --> 00:21:00,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I really like calligraphy</font>

532
00:21:00,480 --> 00:21:01,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">so I decided to learn from you.</font>

533
00:21:02,510 --> 00:21:04,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you are going to be busy after this,</font>

534
00:21:04,200 --> 00:21:05,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I can help you out anytime.</font>

535
00:21:13,940 --> 00:21:17,270
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Rest in peace! Presented with respect from Qingliangshan Funeral Home]</font>

536
00:21:17,270 --> 00:21:17,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">See?</font>

537
00:21:18,590 --> 00:21:21,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I probably won't be busy any longer.</font>

538
00:21:23,830 --> 00:21:26,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You said you wanted to learn the semi-cursive script before.</font>

539
00:21:26,270 --> 00:21:27,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've not had a chance to show you.</font>

540
00:21:28,240 --> 00:21:29,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me show you today.</font>

541
00:21:50,110 --> 00:21:52,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The humble flowers bloom both white and red.</font>

542
00:21:54,270 --> 00:21:56,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Even in my later years, I still delight in this craft.</font>

543
00:21:58,920 --> 00:22:01,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Better to wither fragrant upon the branch</font>

544
00:22:04,000 --> 00:22:05,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">than dance with fallen leaves</font>

545
00:22:06,240 --> 00:22:07,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">in the autumn wind.</font>

546
00:22:14,070 --> 00:22:15,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hexu, there's no use feeling anxious.</font>

547
00:22:15,960 --> 00:22:17,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is the trend.</font>

548
00:22:17,750 --> 00:22:18,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It even happens in a small place like ours.</font>

549
00:22:18,880 --> 00:22:19,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Nowadays,</font>

550
00:22:20,000 --> 00:22:21,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">many job openings require AI knowledge.</font>

551
00:22:22,680 --> 00:22:23,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's think positively.</font>

552
00:22:24,160 --> 00:22:25,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Technology improves lives.</font>

553
00:22:26,200 --> 00:22:27,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Isn't that good?</font>

554
00:22:30,200 --> 00:22:30,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can!</font>

555
00:22:31,720 --> 00:22:32,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Sir. - I've been looking for you.</font>

556
00:22:32,790 --> 00:22:33,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mr. Fang.</font>

557
00:22:35,920 --> 00:22:36,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Slow down, sir.</font>

558
00:22:36,790 --> 00:22:38,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't worry. Stop.</font>

559
00:22:39,310 --> 00:22:40,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Look at you.</font>

560
00:22:40,960 --> 00:22:41,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Look.</font>

561
00:22:42,110 --> 00:22:42,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on, kids.</font>

562
00:22:43,510 --> 00:22:44,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I just picked them. Try one.</font>

563
00:22:46,000 --> 00:22:46,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thank you, Mr. Fang.</font>

564
00:22:49,000 --> 00:22:50,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are there still lotus seeds in the autumn?</font>

565
00:22:51,510 --> 00:22:53,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Lotus seeds that grow late are sweet.</font>

566
00:22:54,640 --> 00:22:55,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sweet.</font>

567
00:22:55,510 --> 00:22:56,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Lotus seeds.</font>

568
00:22:59,240 --> 00:23:00,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They say they will bring you children.</font>

569
00:23:04,750 --> 00:23:05,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's sweet.</font>

570
00:23:05,680 --> 00:23:06,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sweet, right?</font>

