<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Everlasting love...</font>

586
00:23:55,720 --> 00:23:56,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Everlasting love...</font>

587
00:24:05,550 --> 00:24:06,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You beat it up nicely.</font>

588
00:24:19,830 --> 00:24:20,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What month is it?</font>

589
00:24:20,720 --> 00:24:21,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why is it still so hot?</font>

590
00:24:22,480 --> 00:24:24,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's because of the location.</font>

591
00:24:24,310 --> 00:24:26,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We're at a low latitude and close to the sea.</font>

592
00:24:26,680 --> 00:24:28,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's clear, hot, and it rains less.</font>

593
00:24:28,270 --> 00:24:29,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Naturally, the temperature is high.</font>

594
00:24:29,110 --> 00:24:30,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I have a friend from the north.</font>

595
00:24:30,400 --> 00:24:32,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She says her funeral home has started using autumn uniforms.</font>

596
00:24:36,270 --> 00:24:37,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's nice to have four distinct seasons.</font>

597
00:24:52,270 --> 00:24:52,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Over here.</font>

598
00:24:53,440 --> 00:24:54,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's dirty. Throw it away right now.</font>

599
00:24:54,960 --> 00:24:57,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mom, look. I picked this up for Grandpa.</font>

600
00:24:58,030 --> 00:24:58,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hello.</font>

601
00:24:58,830 --> 00:24:59,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes.</font>

602
00:25:00,110 --> 00:25:01,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've got everything arranged.</font>

603
00:25:01,750 --> 00:25:02,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes. I understand.</font>

604
00:25:03,200 --> 00:25:04,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I have something going on back home.</font>

605
00:25:05,400 --> 00:25:06,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sorry. I'm busy.</font>

606
00:25:11,550 --> 00:25:12,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mom.</font>

607
00:26:00,400 --> 00:26:01,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This city doesn't have four seasons.</font>

608
00:26:03,640 --> 00:26:04,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But we have</font>

609
00:26:06,070 --> 00:26:07,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">four seasons in life.</font>

610
00:26:11,400 --> 00:26:12,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A person's youth</font>

611
00:26:12,920 --> 00:26:14,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is like spring.</font>

612
00:26:15,070 --> 00:26:16,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Everything grows...</font>

613
00:26:17,440 --> 00:26:18,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Stop analyzing.</font>

614
00:26:18,310 --> 00:26:19,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's not what Hexu means.</font>

615
00:26:20,070 --> 00:26:21,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hexu, not bad.</font>

616
00:26:21,510 --> 00:26:22,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You are very poetic now.</font>

617
00:26:22,880 --> 00:26:23,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Great.</font>

618
00:26:23,720 --> 00:26:25,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It can be used as Qingliangshan's slogan.</font>

619
00:26:25,320 --> 00:26:25,950
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you crazy?</font>

620
00:26:26,440 --> 00:26:27,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A funeral home doesn't need a slogan.</font>

621
00:26:28,240 --> 00:26:29,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We can use it for the Skills Competition.</font>

622
00:26:30,310 --> 00:26:31,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We've been going through the four seasons of life every day.</font>

623
00:26:31,790 --> 00:26:32,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How great is that?</font>

624
00:26:32,480 --> 00:26:33,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's better than mine,</font>

625
00:26:33,070 --> 00:26:34,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">"I miss you at Qingliangshan."</font>

626
00:26:35,110 --> 00:26:36,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is more poetic.</font>

627
00:26:36,590 --> 00:26:37,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Shut up.</font>

628
00:26:37,750 --> 00:26:38,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No.</font>

629
00:26:38,240 --> 00:26:38,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Think about it.</font>

630
00:26:38,550 --> 00:26:39,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My previous idea was</font>

631
00:26:39,350 --> 00:26:40,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">"I miss you at Qingliangshan."</font>

632
00:26:41,310 --> 00:26:42,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Summer this year</font>

633
00:26:43,350 --> 00:26:44,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is very long</font>

634
00:26:45,400 --> 00:26:46,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and very lively.</font>

635
00:26:47,510 --> 00:26:49,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But in terms of the number of days,</font>

636
00:26:49,400 --> 00:26:52,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">this year's summer is just the same as last year's.</font>

637
00:26:55,550 --> 00:26:57,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How come she lacks common knowledge?</font>

638
00:27:03,030 --> 00:27:03,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're still working?</font>

639
00:27:04,510 --> 00:27:05,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you revising in secret</font>

640
00:27:05,880 --> 00:27:07,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">for the Skills Competition?</font>

641
00:27:07,880 --> 00:27:09,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do you know that participating in the competition</font>

642
00:27:09,310 --> 00:27:10,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">requires you to join the in-house selection first?</font>

643
00:27:10,790 --> 00:27:11,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is a selection necessary?</font>

644
00:27:12,110 --> 00:27:13,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Isn't the mortuary prep team the only one that can compete?</font>

645
00:27:14,510 --> 00:27:16,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Mortuary Care Department will also join this time.</font>

646
00:27:16,790 --> 00:27:18,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">However, there's only one slot available.</font>

647
00:27:18,270 --> 00:27:19,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We still need to compete against the Mortuary Care Department.</font>

648
00:27:20,720 --> 00:27:21,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay. But what's there to be afraid of?</font>

649
00:27:21,720 --> 00:27:23,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They are rich, but our foundation is deeply rooted.</font>

650
00:27:23,590 --> 00:27:25,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We will beat capital with our skills.</font>

651
00:27:26,160 --> 00:27:26,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's exciting.</font>

652
00:27:26,960 --> 00:27:28,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sure. As long as you're confident.</font>

653
00:27:29,590 --> 00:27:30,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What are you writing?</font>

654
00:27:31,030 --> 00:27:31,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Purposely destroying]
When the incident happened,</font>

655
00:27:31,960 --> 00:27:33,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[the funeral home's cleaning robot]
I found this thing to be very annoying.</font>

656
00:27:33,720 --> 00:27:34,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Letter of Apology]
An evil idea crept into my heart</font>

657
00:27:34,820 --> 00:27:35,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and I got emotional.</font>

658
00:27:35,640 --> 00:27:36,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I lifted my foot and exerted force...</font>

659
00:27:37,030 --> 00:27:37,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Stop reading.</font>

660
00:27:38,110 --> 00:27:39,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Did I ask you to read it?</font>

661
00:27:39,070 --> 00:27:40,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You just started running your mouth.</font>

662
00:27:42,350 --> 00:27:44,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why does your letter of apology sound like it's from Water Margin?</font>

663
00:27:44,790 --> 00:27:45,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm trying to meet the word count.</font>

664
00:27:45,880 --> 00:27:46,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's easy.</font>

665
00:27:46,830 --> 00:27:48,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll ask Mr. Fang</font>

666
00:27:48,680 --> 00:27:49,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to get the robot's instruction manual.</font>

667
00:27:49,480 --> 00:27:50,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just copy it.</font>

668
00:27:53,000 --> 00:27:53,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Answer it.</font>

669
00:27:56,510 --> 00:27:57,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hello.</font>

670
00:27:57,960 --> 00:27:59,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hello. I want a big one.</font>

671
00:28:00,310 --> 00:28:00,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We have six people over here.</font>

672
00:28:02,030 --> 00:28:02,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hello.</font>

673
00:28:03,160 --> 00:28:05,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you ordering for yourself</font>

674
00:28:05,030 --> 00:28:06,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">or someone else?</font>

675
00:28:07,160 --> 00:28:08,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Six people. I want a big one.</font>

676
00:28:09,000 --> 00:28:10,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hurry up. I'll be there soon.</font>

677
00:28:11,270 --> 00:28:12,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So you know</font>

678
00:28:12,480 --> 00:28:14,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that you'll be here soon?</font>

679
00:28:14,030 --> 00:28:15,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You still sound healthy.</font>

680
00:28:15,480 --> 00:28:16,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You can probably still make it if you go to the hospital.</font>

681
00:28:17,000 --> 00:28:17,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We don't have</font>

682
00:28:18,200 --> 00:28:19,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">an oven that burns six people at once.</font>

683
00:28:19,750 --> 00:28:20,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We won't be able to separate your ashes.</font>

684
00:28:20,880 --> 00:28:22,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you crazy? What are you talking about?</font>

685
00:28:22,720 --> 00:28:23,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What is this place?</font>

686
00:28:23,440 --> 00:28:24,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is Qingliangshan Funeral Home.</font>

687
00:28:28,030 --> 00:28:28,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Seriously.</font>

688
00:28:29,110 --> 00:28:31,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">People nowadays make calls carelessly.</font>

689
00:28:32,590 --> 00:28:33,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It happens a few times every month.</font>

690
00:28:34,830 --> 00:28:35,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sometimes,</font>

691
00:28:36,590 --> 00:28:37,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we do get calls</font>

692
00:28:37,640 --> 00:28:38,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">from people who want to commit suicide.</font>

693
00:28:43,880 --> 00:28:46,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What should we do in this situation?</font>

694
00:28:47,440 --> 00:28:48,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Transfer it to the business department.</font>

695
00:28:48,880 --> 00:28:49,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Someone on duty</font>

696
00:28:49,960 --> 00:28:51,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">will contact the Life Care Hotline.</font>

697
00:28:52,070 --> 00:28:53,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There are also emergency situations.</font>

698
00:28:54,160 --> 00:28:55,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We usually call the police directly.</font>

699
00:29:09,750 --> 00:29:10,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm not answering.</font>

700
00:29:10,270 --> 00:29:10,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You...</font>

701
00:29:10,960 --> 00:29:11,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Answer it. Hurry.</font>

702
00:29:15,750 --> 00:29:16,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hello.</font>

703
00:29:18,200 --> 00:29:18,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sure.</font>

704
00:29:20,070 --> 00:29:20,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Prepare to receive a body.</font>

705
00:29:30,640 --> 00:29:31,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Dandan.</font>

706
00:29:32,350 --> 00:29:33,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come and take a look.</font>

707
00:29:34,750 --> 00:29:35,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What's wrong?</font>

708
00:29:36,550 --> 00:29:38,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I received this body last night.</font>

709
00:29:38,750 --> 00:29:41,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There's a huge tumor on the right side of his face.</font>

710
00:29:41,920 --> 00:29:42,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's ulcerating.</font>

711
00:29:43,270 --> 00:29:44,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's not noted in the sheets.</font>

712
00:29:44,750 --> 00:29:47,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't know if the family members want it fixed.</font>

713
00:29:47,510 --> 00:29:49,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This looks like mouth cancer.</font>

714
00:29:49,550 --> 00:29:51,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I think it has tortured him for a long time.</font>

715
00:29:51,960 --> 00:29:53,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He probably couldn't bite for a long time.</font>

716
00:29:55,920 --> 00:29:57,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What do you think?</font>

717
00:29:58,790 --> 00:30:00,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Although the deceased did not receive treatment,</font>

718
00:30:00,720 --> 00:30:01,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I am confident</font>

719
00:30:01,680 --> 00:30:03,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">about fixing his face to the way he looked before he got sick.</font>

720
00:30:05,110 --> 00:30:06,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I have to ask the family members.</font>

721
00:30:06,830 --> 00:30:07,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's fine.</font>

722
00:30:07,750 --> 00:30:08,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm not taking any payment for this.</font>

723
00:30:15,110 --> 00:30:16,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you are going to do this,</font>

724
00:30:16,790 --> 00:30:18,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you need to prepare the facial wax beforehand.</font>

725
00:30:18,510 --> 00:30:19,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's a very trying process.</font>

726
00:30:19,880 --> 00:30:20,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can you do it?</font>

727
00:30:21,070 --> 00:30:21,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I can.</font>

728
00:30:23,440 --> 00:30:23,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sure.</font>

729
00:30:23,830 --> 00:30:25,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll talk to the family members about this.</font>

730
00:30:25,880 --> 00:30:26,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thank you, Dandan.</font>

731
00:30:40,550 --> 00:30:41,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What are you looking at? Get to work.</font>

732
00:30:57,310 --> 00:30:58,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The night is serene,</font>

733
00:30:59,550 --> 00:31:01,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">beneath a sky full of stars.</font>

734
00:31:02,030 --> 00:31:04,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Welcome to the late-night radio.</font>

735
00:31:05,680 --> 00:31:08,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">In this time that belongs only to us,</font>

736
00:31:09,240 --> 00:31:10,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">let our souls</font>

737
00:31:10,400 --> 00:31:12,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">surrender to the quiet night.</font>

738
00:31:13,310 --> 00:31:15,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let life's little troubles and pressures</font>

739
00:31:16,240 --> 00:31:18,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">fade away with the radio waves</font>

740
00:31:18,160 --> 00:31:20,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">into the endless night sky.</font>

741
00:31:21,550 --> 00:31:23,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- I, Wang Can... - Wang Can!</font>

742
00:31:24,790 --> 00:31:25,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What are you doing?</font>

743
00:31:26,550 --> 00:31:27,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You can reply to me?</font>

744
00:31:28,270 --> 00:31:30,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who else do you think you are talking to?</font>

745
00:31:30,550 --> 00:31:31,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Dear listener,</font>

746
00:31:31,750 --> 00:31:32,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">please hold on.</font>

747
00:31:32,310 --> 00:31:33,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm not done with my opening yet.</font>

748
00:31:33,240 --> 00:31:33,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Shut up.</font>

749
00:31:34,310 --> 00:31:35,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you are really bored,</font>

750
00:31:35,480 --> 00:31:37,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I advise you to revise your Fifth Level Worker materials.</font>

751
00:31:37,240 --> 00:31:37,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't disturb me.</font>

752
00:31:38,110 --> 00:31:39,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm worried that you might be bored.</font>

753
00:31:39,590 --> 00:31:40,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm not bored. I'm busy.</font>

754
00:31:40,750 --> 00:31:41,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I have important things to do.</font>

755
00:31:42,030 --> 00:31:43,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">One more thing. I'm telling you.</font>

756
00:31:43,270 --> 00:31:45,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This pager is for work.</font>

757
00:31:45,240 --> 00:31:46,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't use it to wail and howl here.</font>

758
00:31:47,310 --> 00:31:49,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Stop talking. Understand?</font>

759
00:31:54,110 --> 00:31:54,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Understand.</font>

760
00:32:16,830 --> 00:32:17,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The night is serene,</font>

761
00:32:18,920 --> 00:32:20,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">beneath a sky full of stars.</font>

762
00:32:22,960 --> 00:32:23,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't be angry.</font>

763
00:32:23,880 --> 00:32:24,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I have something important.</font>

764
00:32:24,880 --> 00:32:25,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What is it?</font>

765
00:32:25,880 --> 00:32:27,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The letter of apology you wrote yesterday</font>

766
00:32:28,270 --> 00:32:30,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">had room for improvement</font>

767
00:32:30,640 --> 00:32:32,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">so I improved it for you.</font>

768
00:32:32,400 --> 00:32:33,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I finished writing it.</font>

769
00:32:33,750 --> 00:32:34,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Listen to this first.</font>

770
00:32:35,440 --> 00:32:37,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It was a bright and sunny day.</font>

771
00:32:38,160 --> 00:32:40,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The cicadas shrilled and the scent of wine still lingered.</font>

772
00:32:41,480 --> 00:32:43,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The robot stood there coldly</font>

773
00:32:44,030 --> 00:32:44,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">like a swordsman who could not smile...</font>

774
00:32:44,550 --> 00:32:45,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What even is this?</font>

775
00:32:45,830 --> 00:32:46,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I didn't drink.</font>

776
00:32:47,240 --> 00:32:47,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Next.</font>

777
00:32:48,040 --> 00:32:49,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I wrote it in your style.</font>

778
00:32:50,200 --> 00:32:51,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's not my style.</font>

779
00:32:52,920 --> 00:32:54,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This one. I'm sure you enjoy this.</font>

780
00:32:54,440 --> 00:32:54,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That day,</font>

781
00:32:55,160 --> 00:32:56,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the cold operating noise of the robot</font>

782
00:32:56,510 --> 00:32:57,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">pierced my final layer of rationality</font>

783
00:32:57,920 --> 00:32:59,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">like a formless steel needle.</font>

784
00:32:59,480 --> 00:33:01,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I couldn't stand it anymore. I got angry</font>

785
00:33:01,480 --> 00:33:03,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">like a misunderstood CEO male lead.</font>

786
00:33:03,750 --> 00:33:04,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What?</font>

787
00:33:04,110 --> 00:33:05,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Because of my deep...</font>

788
00:33:05,640 --> 00:33:06,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">CEO male lead?</font>

789
00:33:07,200 --> 00:33:08,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is absurd.</font>

790
00:33:08,310 --> 00:33:09,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't you love reading these novels?</font>

791
00:33:09,750 --> 00:33:10,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't.</font>

792
00:33:10,720 --> 00:33:12,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Song Tianshuang is the one who enjoys that.</font>

793
00:33:12,510 --> 00:33:14,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Give me one with some warmth.</font>

794
00:33:14,480 --> 00:33:15,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Something that I would write.</font>

795
00:33:15,960 --> 00:33:17,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Warmth isn't your style.</font>

796
00:33:17,720 --> 00:33:18,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How so?</font>

797
00:33:18,590 --> 00:33:19,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Listen to this.</font>

798
00:33:19,480 --> 00:33:20,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- How am I not warm? - This is the best.</font>

799
00:33:20,510 --> 00:33:21,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The clank</font>

800
00:33:21,480 --> 00:33:22,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is still echoing in my ears</font>

801
00:33:22,750 --> 00:33:23,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">just like a slap.</font>

802
00:33:23,750 --> 00:33:24,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A slap? By whom?</font>

803
00:33:24,880 --> 00:33:25,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who is slapping whom?</font>

804
00:33:26,070 --> 00:33:26,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The robot slapped me?</font>

805
00:33:26,880 --> 00:33:27,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Did the robot have hands?</font>

806
00:33:27,750 --> 00:33:28,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's just a metaphor.</font>

807
00:33:28,640 --> 00:33:29,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You need to write honestly.</font>

808
00:33:29,510 --> 00:33:30,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is a letter of apology,</font>

809
00:33:30,310 --> 00:33:31,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">not a novel.</font>

810
00:33:32,030 --> 00:33:32,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is this written by AI?</font>

811
00:33:34,310 --> 00:33:34,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No.</font>

812
00:33:35,720 --> 00:33:36,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It was written</font>

813
00:33:36,960 --> 00:33:37,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">with love.</font>

814
00:33:46,640 --> 00:33:47,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Stop! - I...</font>

815
00:33:48,000 --> 00:33:48,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you still going to come near?</font>

816
00:33:49,110 --> 00:33:49,870
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you still going to disturb me?</font>

817
00:33:49,870 --> 00:33:50,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No.</font>

818
00:33:50,400 --> 00:33:51,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll kill you if you come any closer.</font>

819
00:33:51,310 --> 00:33:52,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I was wrong.</font>

820
00:33:52,750 --> 00:33:53,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go away.</font>

821
00:33:54,830 --> 00:33:55,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I can't even finish my work.</font>

822
00:34:00,350 --> 00:34:00,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I understand.</font>

823
00:34:45,700 --> 00:34:49,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Name: Jiang Yuan, Cause of Death: Car Accident, Body Condition: Complete]</font>

824
00:34:49,500 --> 00:34:51,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Embalmer & Restorative Artist, National Skills Training Material]</font>

825
00:34:54,030 --> 00:34:54,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wang Can.</font>

826
00:34:56,840 --> 00:34:57,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wang Can, are you there?</font>

827
00:34:58,190 --> 00:34:59,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes. What's wrong?</font>

828
00:34:59,960 --> 00:35:02,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Something's wrong at the refrigeration units.</font>

829
00:35:02,710 --> 00:35:04,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come and take a look for me.</font>

830
00:35:04,590 --> 00:35:05,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you're around, I can have a witness.</font>

831
00:35:06,230 --> 00:35:06,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sure.</font>

832
00:35:22,630 --> 00:35:23,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Did you</font>

833
00:35:24,400 --> 00:35:25,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">check this person?</font>

834
00:35:26,190 --> 00:35:26,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes.</font>

835
00:35:26,960 --> 00:35:28,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Dandan and I checked this body.</font>

836
00:35:29,230 --> 00:35:31,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There was nothing when we checked.</font>

837
00:35:31,880 --> 00:35:32,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I think it was dropped inside.</font>

838
00:35:35,960 --> 00:35:36,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you sure?</font>

839
00:35:37,190 --> 00:35:38,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm absolutely sure.</font>

840
00:35:40,880 --> 00:35:41,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me see.</font>

841
00:35:41,590 --> 00:35:42,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Otherwise, we'll have to contact the family members.</font>

842
00:35:44,630 --> 00:35:47,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jiang Yuan. Male. 34 years old.</font>

843
00:35:47,440 --> 00:35:48,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Car accident.</font>

844
00:35:49,150 --> 00:35:49,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is he married?</font>

845
00:35:50,000 --> 00:35:50,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why not ask his wife?</font>

846
00:35:54,030 --> 00:35:55,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">His wife is over here.</font>

847
00:36:03,070 --> 00:36:05,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We found this by the deceased's side.</font>

848
00:36:05,840 --> 00:36:07,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Please confirm</font>

849
00:36:07,190 --> 00:36:08,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">if this is the deceased's belongings.</font>

850
00:36:14,920 --> 00:36:16,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When we received the body, it was complete</font>

851
00:36:16,880 --> 00:36:17,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and no restoration was needed.</font>

852
00:36:18,400 --> 00:36:20,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We only checked it a little and placed it in the refrigeration unit.</font>

853
00:36:21,230 --> 00:36:23,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We were planning to prepare the body for burial before the funeral.</font>

854
00:36:24,000 --> 00:36:25,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm really sorry.</font>

855
00:36:25,280 --> 00:36:26,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We didn't notice this torchlight.</font>

856
00:36:26,920 --> 00:36:28,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm really sorry.</font>

857
00:36:28,280 --> 00:36:29,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I was careless</font>

858
00:36:29,960 --> 00:36:31,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and made all of you come all the way here.</font>

859
00:36:31,840 --> 00:36:32,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But</font>

860
00:36:32,670 --> 00:36:33,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">my uncle and aunt's belongings</font>

861
00:36:33,840 --> 00:36:35,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">were handed over to us at the hospital yesterday.</font>

862
00:36:35,670 --> 00:36:36,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This torchlight...</font>

863
00:36:39,150 --> 00:36:41,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mom and Dad gave this to me.</font>

864
00:36:45,590 --> 00:36:46,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sorry.</font>

865
00:36:47,000 --> 00:36:48,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We don't have many relatives.</font>

866
00:36:48,670 --> 00:36:49,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The kindergarten is on holiday.</font>

867
00:36:50,150 --> 00:36:51,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We couldn't find anyone to take care of her,</font>

868
00:36:51,840 --> 00:36:53,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">so we brought her here.</font>

869
00:36:54,960 --> 00:36:56,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That day at the hospital,</font>

870
00:36:56,440 --> 00:36:58,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I put this in Dad's sleeping bag.</font>

871
00:36:59,190 --> 00:37:02,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We went camping, pitched tents, and slept in sleeping bags.</font>

872
00:37:02,760 --> 00:37:04,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mom and Dad were sound asleep.</font>

873
00:37:22,670 --> 00:37:23,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Little girl,</font>

874
00:37:24,710 --> 00:37:26,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">why did you give this torchlight</font>

875
00:37:26,440 --> 00:37:27,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to your father?</font>

876
00:37:28,630 --> 00:37:31,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I was afraid when I slept in sleeping bags alone.</font>

877
00:37:31,280 --> 00:37:33,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Dad gave me this torchlight.</font>

878
00:37:33,840 --> 00:37:36,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He said I would no longer be afraid of walking in the dark</font>

879
00:37:36,480 --> 00:37:38,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">with it.</font>

880
00:37:38,440 --> 00:37:40,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I can even see the stars if I point it upwards.</font>

881
00:37:41,280 --> 00:37:43,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mom and Dad are sleeping in sleeping bags.</font>

882
00:37:43,320 --> 00:37:45,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm also worried that they might be scared,</font>

883
